ring, quaffed the potion, changed into a marilith.  Wore the shield, tried
to wield the sword: "You cannot wield a two-handed sword while wearing a
shield."  I don't think NH is designed to consider the player having more
than two arms.  (If so, you'd be able to poly into a marilith and then
